###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#RiskStatus
:RiskStatus rdf:type owl:Class ;
            rdfs:subClassOf <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKPlatform#DataEntity> ;
